301	 * the grace days of its person's grade in force on its date, before the sheet's today), the late percent in force on
302	 * that boundary date (the due-by plus the grace plus 30, 60, 90 ... days) of its figure plus the charges of the
303	 * boundaries before it (compounding), rounded like the claim's due, the charges added up; a boundary whose percent is 0.00 adds nothing. It follows the
304	 * sheet's today until the claim is settled, or while a statement binds the claim's due (charge included). A correction, a deferred claim and a claim whose
