    18	 * on or after the sheet's today is {@code forward}-only: it applies only to claims added after it was saved ({@code saved},
    19	 * on the sequence a claim's {@link Claim#added} is on); a claim added before keeps the {@code earlier} version that applied
    20	 * to it (null: none, so the grade has no rate for that from-date for it).
