    47	    /** The {@code days}-th business day after the date on the sheet: counting from the day after it, skipping every
    48	     * Saturday, Sunday and one of the sheet's holidays (as the list stands now); the date itself when {@code days} is 0. */
    49	    public LocalDate businessDaysAfter(String sheetId, LocalDate date, int days) {
